	measure 'Purchasing Power of $100' = ```
			
			VAR BaseCPI = 
			CALCULATE(
			    MIN('Economic Data'[Value]),
			    ALLSELECTED('Calendar'),
			    'Economic Data'[Attribute] = "Headline CPI"
			)
			
			RETURN
			100 * 
			DIVIDE(
			    CALCULATE(
			        [Latest Value],
			        'Economic Data'[Attribute] = "Headline CPI"
			    ),
			    BaseCPI
			)
			```
		formatString: \$#,0.00;(\$#,0.00);\$#,0.00
		displayFolder: Specific Attribute Measures
		lineageTag: 6291700f-22d4-4797-958d-5638c32240d4

